# Gutenberg block naming

All Gutenberg blocks from this plugin use the **`taxo/`** namespace.

## Rules

- Registered name: `taxo/<slug>` (e.g. `taxo/collection-table`).
- Public **title** starts with **`Taxo `** so the block is findable in the inserter by typing `taxo` (e.g. `Taxo Table view`).
- Add keyword `taxo` (and optionally `taxo-<slug>`) in `block.json`.
- Do **not** register new blocks under `wtt/` or other namespaces.
- PHP constant / docs must use the same `taxo/…` name as `block.json`.

## Build

Blocks only appear in the editor after `npm run build` (output under `build/blocks/…`). Without a readable `build/blocks/<name>/block.json`, registration is skipped.
